<title>USA: Detroit $190 mln note deal dates adjusted -Siebert.</title>
<headline>Detroit $190 mln note deal dates adjusted -Siebert.</headline>
<text>
<p>SCHOOL DISTRICT OF THE CITY OF DETROIT</p>
<p>RE: $190,000,000*</p>
<p>WAYNE COUNTY, MICHIGAN</p>
<p>STATE SCHOOL AID NOTES</p>
<p>(LIMITED TAX GENERAL OBLIGATION),</p>
<p>SERIES 1997</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD.</p>
<p>THE ACCOUNT IS CLOSED.</p>
<p>PLEASE NOTE, SETTLEMENT DATE AND DATED DATE HAVE BEEN CHANGED</p>
<p>TO 7/1/97.</p>
<p>   MOODY'S: NA		    S&amp;P: SP-1+</p>
<p>   DATED: 07/01/1997	    FIRST COUPON:</p>
<p>DUE: 05/01</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT*    COUPON	   PRICE</p>
<p>05/01/1998	    190,000M    4.50  %	  3.90</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 100.484)</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: NOTES COMPUTED CODE 2 30/360</p>
<p>* - APPROXIMATE SUBJECT TO CHANGE</p>
<p>The compliance addendum MSRB Rule G-11 will apply.</p>
<p>The award is expected Tuesday, June 24, 1997.</p>
<p>Delivery is expected on July 1, 1997.</p>
<p>This issue is book entry through DTC.</p>
<p>Siebert, Brandford, Shank &amp; Co.</p>
<p>First Chicago Capital Markets, Inc.</p>
<p>First of Michigan Corporation</p>
<p>Mesirow Financial Inc.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
